# >>> paster v3 >>>
# rofi-backed drop-down prompt picker — see __PASTER_DIR__/README.md
# Look/size settings apply on the next toggle (config.yaml); only hotkey
# changes need a ./install.sh re-run. rofi draws and places its own window,
# so no for_window rule is required.
bindsym __PASTER_KEY__ exec --no-startup-id __PASTER_DIR__/bin/toggle.sh
# <<< paster v3 <<<
